                    "challenge": true,
                    "fact": {"id": "rrr-one-chord", "text": {"en": "Leave out the quick passing notes and every note of the tune belongs to one chord, the home chord. That's why it makes such an easy round: any voice fits any other.", "es": "Si quitas las notas de paso rápidas, cada nota de la melodía pertenece a un solo acorde, el acorde de tónica. Por eso es un canon tan fácil: cualquier voz encaja con cualquier otra."}, "source": {"en": "The song's own chords (one chord, C, throughout); Wikipedia, \"Round (music)\"", "es": "Los acordes de la canción (un solo acorde, Do, de principio a fin); Wikipedia, \"Round (music)\""}, "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Round_(music)"}
